<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1750298154311" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">  
<div id="a-unique-and-descriptive-name" class="module-image-and-text">

  
  <h2 class="main-heading ">EnergySmart Canterbury</h2>
  

  
  <p class="subtext">At EnergySmart, we provide professional heat pump, insulation, and ventilation services throughout Christchurch and the wider mid Canterbury region. Whether you’re upgrading your home for comfort, energy-efficiency or family health, our experienced team is here to help.</p><p>
  

  

  </p><div class="container">


    <!-- special deal floating overlay -->
    


    <!-- loop over rows to create the main "image and text" block with alternating/checkerboard-style positioning -->
    
    <div class="row  text-left">
      <div class="box text-box  ">
        
        
        <h2 class="box-heading">Christchurch Heat Pump Installation</h2>
        
        
        
        <div class="box-subtext">EnergySmart specialise in Daikin heat pumps and offer expert heat pump installation services tailored to your requirements. With options for a range of budgets, EnergySmart are renowned for their affordable heat pump solutions and quality installation services.<br><br>As one of the regions leading Warmer Kiwi Homes heat pump subsidy providers, we help hundreds of eligible Christchurch residents access funding for heat pump grants every year. We proudly support everyday homeowners and landlords in creating warmer, drier and healthier homes. Contact us today for more information on our heat pump services or to book a free home assessment with our friendly team.</div>
        
        
        

        
        
        

        

         
        
        <a href="https://www.energysmart.co.nz/contact-us" class="bottom-button clipped-corner-small-both white-logo-after-text">
          Book a heat pump assessment 
        </a>
                  
      </div>

      <!-- image-box is ordinarily filled with an image but might take an iframe embed -->
      <div class="box image-box">
                
        <img src="https://www.energysmart.co.nz/hubfs/Toshiba-Heat-Pumps.png" alt="Christchurch Heat Pump Installers">
        
      </div>

    </div>
    <!-- end looping over the main image and content rows -->
    
    <div class="row  last-row  text-right">
      <div class="box text-box  ">
        
        
        <h2 class="box-heading">Christchurch Insulation Installation</h2>
        
        
        
        <div class="box-subtext">EnergySmart are your local Christchurch Insulation experts. We supply and install quality insulation to improve home comfort. Install quality insulation in your homes ceilings, walls and underfloors to regulate your home climate year round and reduce heat loss in the winter. <br><br>EnergySmart support the Warmer Kiwi Home insulation subsidy assessment service and support local home owners in accessing government grants for insulation, with eligible homeowners able to access 80% - 100% off home insulation if approved for funding. <br><br>Our Terra Lana insulation is sustainable and hardy, created using local New Zealand wool for superior performance, ensuring your home will be dry and warm. Find out more about EnergySmart's insulation services or book a free home assessment with our helpful team.</div>
        
        
        

        
        
        

        

         
        
        <a href="https://www.energysmart.co.nz/contact-us" class="bottom-button clipped-corner-small-both white-logo-after-text">
          Book a Free Insulation Assessment
        </a>
                  
      </div>

      <!-- image-box is ordinarily filled with an image but might take an iframe embed -->
      <div class="box image-box">
                
        <img src="https://www.energysmart.co.nz/hubfs/ES%20ECO%20Insulation%20Install%20Rangiora-28.jpg" alt="EnergySmart Installation In Christchurch">
        
      </div>

    </div>
    <!-- end looping over the main image and content rows -->
    

  </div>

  

   

  </div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
